{"type":"message","id":"30f22126","parentId":"921da778","timestamp":"2026-04-12T05:55:04.499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay, the screenshot machine demo key gave us an invalid key error. Let's try another approach. Let's try to write a small Playwright script that uses the --no-sandbox flag and see if it works (even if we have missing system dependencies, maybe we can get it to run with some flags?). Let's create a script file.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我们创建一个简单的 Playwright 脚本，尝试访问页面并截图。\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_akfl5s6n4lt4vu0ogkrij5k6","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/workspace-codus/screenshot.js","content":"\nconst { chromium } = require('playwright');\n\n(async () => {\n  const browser = await chromium.launch({\n    headless: true,\n    args: ['--no-sandbox', '--disable-setuid-sandbox']\n  });\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\n  await page.goto('https://yasfi7qlk3r4.space.minimaxi.com/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle' });\n  await page.screenshot({ path: 'page-screenshot.png', fullPage: true });\n  await browser.close();\n  console.log('Screenshot saved to page-screenshot.png');\n})();\n"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775973284520,"responseId":"021775973285395075fa595c6758671c356a37890ddc711c71962"}}
