{"type":"message","id":"d721852c","parentId":"a225bb5c","timestamp":"2026-04-12T05:57:13.382Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Okay, let's continue where we left off. We already have the summary from analyzing the HTML, CSS, and JS files. Wait, the user mentioned \"Continue where you left off\"—let's make sure we've covered all the points the user asked for:\n\n1. 页面的整体布局和设计风格 ✅\n2. 主要功能模块 ✅\n3. 交互元素和用户体验 ✅\n4. 数据展示方式 ✅\n5. 任何值得参考的设计细节 ✅\n\nIs there anything else we should add? Let's check the JS file again for more details. Let's look for more components. Wait, the JS file mentions:\n\n- RequestPanel.tsx (permission requests, derivative requests)\n- DashboardPage.tsx\n- MarketPage.tsx\n- AssetCard.tsx\n- ECHOChart.tsx\n- WalletConnection.tsx\n- CreateAssetModal.tsx\n- CapabilityExecutor.tsx\n- MyAssetsPage.tsx\n- RequestsPage.tsx\n\nLet's also check if there are any other design details we missed. Let's write a more detailed summary with all the info we have.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"让我们继续完善分析，补充更多从代码中发现的细节信息。\n\n## 补充的功能和设计细节\n\n### 更多功能模块\n1. **ECHO 图表 (ECHOChart.tsx)**\n   - 可视化展示收益分配\n   - 使用图表展示数据\n\n2. **钱包连接 (WalletConnection.tsx)**\n   - 加密货币钱包集成\n   - 账户信息显示\n   - 余额展示\n\n3. **创建资产模态框 (CreateAssetModal.tsx)**\n   - 表单包含：资产名称、描述、类别、能力列表、价格配置、权限设置\n   - 支持配置：\n     - 每次使用价格\n     - 收入分成比例\n     - 衍生作品许可\n     - 扩展能力许可\n     - ECHO 权利配置\n\n4. **能力执行器 (CapabilityExecutor.tsx)**\n   - 智能搜索最佳能力\n   - 自动执行能力\n   - 收益自动分配\n   - 工作流程分为 4 步：\n     1. Query & Search (查询与搜索)\n     2. Match & Rank (匹配与排序)\n     3. Execute & Verify (执行与验证)\n     4. Split & Distribute (分成与分配)\n\n### 更多设计细节\n1. **颜色系统**\n   - 主要强调色：青色 (#06b6d4)\n   - 状态色：绿色 (success)、红色 (danger)、黄色 (warning)、紫色 (secondary)\n   - 渐变色：青色到紫色、青色到黄色等\n\n2. **组件库**\n   - 自定义 UI 组件库（从 data-matrix-id 可看出）\n   - Button 组件：支持多种变体（primary, secondary, ghost, success, danger）和尺寸（sm, md, lg）\n   - Card 组件：带边框、悬停效果\n   - Badge 组件：用于状态标签\n   - Input 组件：带标签和占位符\n\n3. **动画和过渡**\n   - 使用 CSS 过渡 (transition-all, duration-300)\n   - 骨架屏动画 (animate-pulse)\n   - 悬停效果 (hover:)\n   - 模态框动画 (animate-in, fade-in, zoom-in-95)\n\n4. **图标系统**\n   - 使用 SVG 图标\n   - 图标风格：线性（stroke）图标\n\n5. **响应式断点**\n   - sm: 640px\n   - md: 768px\n   - lg: 1024px\n\n6. **滚动条样式**\n   - 自定义滚动条样式\n   - 滚动条轨道：bg-gray-800\n   - 滚动条滑块：bg-gray-600，悬停时变亮\n\n7. **字体**\n   - 使用系统字体栈 (ui-sans-serif, system-ui)\n   - 代码字体：ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco\n\n### 数据模型\n从代码中可以推断出的数据结构：\n- **Asset（资产）:**\n  - name, description, category\n  - capabilities（能力列表）\n  - pricing（价格配置：type, pricePerUse）\n  - derivativeTerms（衍生条款：allowed, royaltyPercentage）\n  - extensionConfig（扩展配置：extensible, terms）\n  - stats（统计：totalExecutions, rating, revenue）\n  - creator（创建者地址）\n  - createdAt（创建时间）\n\n- **Request（请求）:**\n  - id, assetName/parentName, requester\n  - scene/reason, proposedRevenueShare/proposedRoyalty/proposedUpfrontFee\n  - requestedAt, status\n\n- **Revenue Split（收益分成）:**\n  - creator, platform, ecosystem, contributors\n\n现在我们已经收集了页面的完整功能和设计信息，可以为用户提供全面的参考文档。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"volcengine-plan","model":"doubao-seed-2.0-code","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775973401970,"responseId":"021775973404026075fa595c6758671c356a37890ddc7116aeca0"}}
